Z||000000||DRA||06-22-2000||03:44 PM||||Wifes ex mother inlaw works for a ford dealer ship. I needed new rubber and was looking at the Dunlop A60's but having a cash flow problem. Wifes ex-inlaw at ford dealer ship said she could not get the dunlops but could front me goodrich comp t/a's. Dropped car off and picked it up in the rain not paying attention to the tires, got home looked, "Grand Am Radial GT" tires had been installed. Anyone know who makes these or any other data on them? Don't see anything on the tire that identifies the manufacturer.||||reg||1
